{"seq":3,"slug":"rate-service-tradeoff","title":"价格/时效/可追踪性权衡排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/logistics-rate-shopping-platform/rate-comparison/rate-service-tradeoff","wordCount":2394,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"价格-时效-可追踪性权衡排序\">价格/时效/可追踪性权衡排序</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>归一见效之后，你手上有一组可比的报价，每条报价有价格、时效、可追踪性、赔付条款、清关方式等属性。现在要回答用户的真实问题：「我该选哪个」。这看起来是一次 <code>sort by price</code>，但立刻会遇到三个反驳：最便宜的可能是最慢且丢件不赔的邮政小包；最快的可能贵三倍；而「可追踪性」这个维度既不是数字也不是布尔，它在不同承运商之间不可直接比较。</p>\n<p>本文讲的是排序这一层的设计：<strong>多目标如何加权</strong>、<strong>用户偏好如何表达与持久化</strong>、<strong>排序结果如何解释</strong>。边界上，报价的<strong>来源与归一化</strong>在 <a href=\"rate-api-aggregation\">多承运商报价 API 聚合归一化</a>，<strong>输入的规范化</strong>在 <a href=\"rate-input-normalize\">重量/尺寸/地址输入标准化</a>；一个排序结果被选定之后如何真正下单，是 <a href=\"../purchase-label/one-click-purchase\">选定方案在线下单与运费支付</a> 的主题。本文不涉及下单，只到「输出一个有序列表 + 推荐理由」为止。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;归一化报价集合&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;硬约束过滤&lt;br/&gt;超出承诺时效 / 不可服务 / 不含必需能力&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;可行报价集合&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;维度打分&lt;br/&gt;价格分 / 时效分 / 追踪分 / 风险分&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;权重合成&lt;br/&gt;用户偏好 或 场景默认&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;排序 + 分档&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;生成推荐理由&lt;br/&gt;为什么这单排第一&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;用户确认或修改偏好&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;选定报价&lt;br/&gt;进入下单流程&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; J[&quot;偏好回写&lt;br/&gt;下次作为默认&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"归一化报价集合\"] --&gt; B[\"硬约束过滤&lt;br/&gt;超出承诺时效 / 不可服务 / 不含必需能力\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"可行报价集合\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"维度打分&lt;br/&gt;价格分 / 时效分 / 追踪分 / 风险分\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"权重合成&lt;br/&gt;用户偏好 或 场景默认\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"排序 + 分档\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"生成推荐理由&lt;br/&gt;为什么这单排第一\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"用户确认或修改偏好\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"选定报价&lt;br/&gt;进入下单流程\"]\n    H --&gt; J[\"偏好回写&lt;br/&gt;下次作为默认\"]</pre><p><code>G</code> 这一步常被当作锦上添花，其实是排序系统能否被信任的关键：用户看到「推荐：专线 A，$18.4，7-12 天」，如果不给理由，他会怀疑这是不是平台想推的；给了理由（「比最快方案省 42%，只慢 2 天」），他会用自己的偏好去校准。<strong>一个不能解释的排序无法被用户修正，也就无法优化。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"多重目标如何合成\">多重目标如何合成</h2><p>排序的输入是若干维度，每个维度的性质不同，需要先分别处理再合成。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>数据形态</th>\n<th>打分处理</th>\n<th>常见陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格</td>\n<td>绝对金额（本币）</td>\n<td>相对归一化，避免绝对金额的量纲影响</td>\n<td>用绝对金额做权重会让贵包裹的所有方案趋同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效</td>\n<td>区间（如 7-12 天）</td>\n<td>用分位数或区间中点，不用承诺值</td>\n<td>用承诺值会奖励「承诺宽松」的承运商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可追踪性</td>\n<td>分级（无追踪/起运追踪/全链路/含签收）</td>\n<td>序数映射到分值</td>\n<td>当作布尔会丢掉中间档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠性</td>\n<td>历史妥投率、平均延误</td>\n<td>由历史数据估计</td>\n<td>新承运商无历史，需冷启动策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险</td>\n<td>赔付条款、清关方式</td>\n<td>分级</td>\n<td>与价格强相关，需注意共线性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>价格分</strong>不应该用绝对金额。合理的做法是在本次候选集合内做相对归一化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>price</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{price}}(i) = \\frac{C_{\\max} - C_i}{C_{\\max} - C_{\\min}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">price</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这样做的效果是：无论包裹是 8 美元还是 800 美元，价格维度都在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 上展开，权重才有统一含义。如果直接用绝对金额，一个 800 美元的报价集合里，10 美元的差价几乎不影响排序，而同样 10 美元的差价在 8 美元集合里是决定性的——这在业务上未必是错的（绝对省钱的绝对值相同），但它把「权重」的含义从「偏好」变成了「金额量级」，通常不是想要的。</p>\n<p><strong>时效分</strong>要用实测分布或承诺区间的下界与上界，而不是承运商宣传的「3-5 天」承诺。跨境承运商的承诺时效普遍偏乐观，用承诺值排序会让所有承运商看起来差不多，而实测 P90 才能拉开差距。时效的估计方法在运单章节的 <a href=\"../unified-shipment/tracking-aggregator\">多承运商轨迹聚合</a> 里有更完整的讨论（它消费的是同一批实测数据）。</p>\n<p><strong>可追踪性</strong>是一个被低估的维度。它的分级大致是：无追踪（部分邮政小包）→ 仅起运国扫描 → 全链路扫描 → 含签收凭证（POD）。对卖家而言，无追踪意味着买家投诉「没收到」时无法自证，纠纷成本远高于运费差。所以可追踪性不该被当成一个可选加分项，而应该是<strong>硬约束或高权重维度</strong>：许多卖家会设置「低于全链路追踪的方案一律不展示」，这是一个硬过滤而不是打分。</p>\n<p>合成公式的最简形态是加权和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>price</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>time</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>track</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>risk</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Score}(i) = w_p \\cdot s_{\\text{price}}(i) + w_t \\cdot s_{\\text{time}}(i) + w_r \\cdot s_{\\text{track}}(i) + w_e \\cdot s_{\\text{risk}}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">price</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">time</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">track</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">risk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>权重来自用户画像或场景默认。但有几个必须注意的性质：<strong>权重之和应为 1</strong>（否则不同包裹之间的分数不可比），<strong>权重应被约束在合理范围</strong>（避免用户配置出「只看价格不看任何风险」的极端，导致他事后投诉），以及<strong>排序应该分档而不是完全连续</strong>——前两名差距很小时，应展示为「价格相近，均可」而不是制造一个虚假的第一名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户偏好-从隐式行为到显式配置\">用户偏好：从隐式行为到显式配置</h2><p>权重的来源有三种，实际系统里通常三层叠加：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>场景默认</strong>：B2C 小包默认偏价格，B2B 大货默认偏时效与可靠性，退货默认偏便宜（因为不紧急）。这些默认由平台设定。</li>\n<li><strong>显式配置</strong>：卖家在账户级或单次下单时设置偏好，例如「我要求全链路追踪」「优先三家合约承运商」「不要邮政类」。这是最稳的信号。</li>\n<li><strong>隐式推断</strong>：从历史选择行为推断——如果他连续十次在价格相近时都选了更快的那个，说明他偏时效。隐式推断要谨慎使用，并且<strong>必须让用户可见可覆盖</strong>，否则会出现「系统猜错了我的偏好且我改不掉」的挫败。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>工程上建议的顺序是：硬约束（显式配置里的一票否决）→ 权重（显式 &gt; 场景默认 &gt; 隐式，后两者按置信度混合）→ 排序。<strong>硬约束与权重必须分开建模</strong>：如果「必须全链路追踪」被表达成一个很大的权重而不是过滤器，那么当所有方案都无追踪时，系统会返回一个追踪分全为零但仍在排序的结果，而不是明确告诉用户「你的条件下没有可用方案」。这个区别在用户侧体验上是天壤之别。</p>\n<p>偏好还要处理<strong>冲突与不可满足</strong>。用户设置「最便宜 + 全链路追踪 + 5 天内到达」，这三个条件可能无解。系统的责任是明确说明哪一条被放宽了、代价是多少，而不是静默地丢弃一条。实现上，把硬约束做成可松弛的软约束（带惩罚项），当无解时给出「放宽 X 后满足条件的最优方案」，并在 UI 上标注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排序结果的可解释性与分档\">排序结果的可解释性与分档</h2><p>排序输出的不是列表，而是一个<strong>带理由的推荐结构</strong>。最小形态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"RankedQuotes {&#10;  recommended: QuoteRef          # 首位，附理由&#10;  alternatives: List&lt;{QuoteRef, tradeoff_note}&gt;&#10;  filtered_out: List&lt;{QuoteRef, reason}&gt;   # 被硬约束剔除的，可展开&#10;  preference_used: PreferenceSnapshot&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>RankedQuotes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  recommended: QuoteRef          # 首位，附理由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  alternatives: List&#x3C;{QuoteRef, tradeoff_note}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filtered_out: List&#x3C;{QuoteRef, reason}>   # 被硬约束剔除的，可展开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  preference_used: PreferenceSnapshot</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>四个字段各有用途。<code>recommended</code> 带理由解决信任问题；<code>alternatives</code> 里的 <code>tradeoff_note</code> 给出相对首位的交换关系（「快 2 天，贵 38%」），让用户能一键切换；<code>filtered_out</code> 解决「为什么我看不到某某快递」的疑问——这是客服工单的高频来源，把它展示出来能显著降低支持成本；<code>preference_used</code> 让排序可复现、可申诉。</p>\n<p><strong>分档</strong>（bucketing）是排序的收尾动作。把连续的分数切成「最便宜」「最快」「均衡」三到四档，每档取代表，比给一个精确排序更符合用户决策习惯。原因在于用户并不在乎第三名和第四名的分数差，他在乎的是「我是在省钱还是在省时间」。分档的实现要点是<strong>档位定义要稳定</strong>：同一路线的档位标签在不同时间要一致，否则用户会觉得系统在乱变。</p>\n<p>还有一个跨境特有的排序输入：<strong>清关方式与税费责任</strong>。DDP（寄件人承担关税）与 DDU（收件人承担）的报价在价格上差很多，直接比较会得出「DDU 便宜」的结论，但对卖家而言 DDU 意味着买家可能因被收税而拒收，退货成本更高。所以排序层必须把 DDP/DDU 显式作为维度或过滤条件，而不是把它们混进价格里当成折扣。相关税金的计算归平台外部的计价与结算系统，本层只做「同一责任口径下比较」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>排序是一层独立的设计：多目标加权、用户偏好表达、结果解释，三者缺一不可。</li>\n<li>价格分用候选集合内的相对归一化，避免绝对金额量纲扭曲权重的含义。</li>\n<li>时效分用实测分位数而非承运商承诺值，否则会奖励承诺宽松的家。</li>\n<li>可追踪性通常应作为硬约束而非加权项；把它当布尔会丢掉「全链路」「含签收」这些关键中间档。</li>\n<li>用户偏好分硬约束与权重两层建模，来源按「显式 &gt; 场景默认 &gt; 隐式」优先级混合；隐式推断必须可见可覆盖。</li>\n<li>无解时松弛硬约束并明确标注放宽了哪一条及代价，不能静默丢弃。</li>\n<li>输出应包含推荐理由、替代方案的交换关系、被过滤项的原因、所用偏好快照，四者共同支撑信任与可复现性。</li>\n<li>用分档替代精确排序更贴合决策习惯，档位定义需跨时间稳定；DDP/DDU 必须显式建模，不能混进价格。</li>\n<li>报价来源与归一化见 <a href=\"rate-api-aggregation\">多承运商报价 API 聚合归一化</a>，输入规范化见 <a href=\"rate-input-normalize\">重量/尺寸/地址输入标准化</a>，选定后下单见 <a href=\"../purchase-label/one-click-purchase\">选定方案在线下单与运费支付</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"价格/时效/可追踪性权衡排序","id":"价格-时效-可追踪性权衡排序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"多重目标如何合成","id":"多重目标如何合成"},{"level":2,"text":"用户偏好：从隐式行为到显式配置","id":"用户偏好-从隐式行为到显式配置"},{"level":2,"text":"排序结果的可解释性与分档","id":"排序结果的可解释性与分档"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"重量/尺寸/地址输入标准化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/logistics-rate-shopping-platform/rate-comparison/rate-input-normalize"},"next":{"title":"选定方案在线下单与运费支付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/logistics-rate-shopping-platform/purchase-label/one-click-purchase"}}